WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.211
Today is a short check, and then a game.

2
00:00:02.661 --> 00:00:07.409
Your child says the sound of each of the ten letters. Then reads the four words.

3
00:00:07.859 --> 00:00:12.606
Do not help on this page. Your child may use the bed to check. That is allowed.

4
00:00:13.056 --> 00:00:15.485
Mark what was right, and add the two numbers.

5
00:00:15.935 --> 00:00:17.905
Twelve or more, go on to day six.

6
00:00:18.355 --> 00:00:24.108
Fewer than twelve, do days two, three and four again, then come back to this page. That is normal.

7
00:00:24.558 --> 00:00:31.383
Then play the game on the next page. Your child says each sound and colors the path, red and blue, to the end.
